OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hunt launched after man
OL,4,Akilled in hit-and-run near Edinburgh
OL,5,AAirport
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are searching for two women and
OL,8,Fa man who fled on foot from the scene
OL,9,Fof a fatal hit-and-run crash on the A8
OL,10,Fnear Edinburgh Airport.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,13,Fcrash involving a grey Mercedes A250, a
OL,14,Fblack Renault Captur, a grey Skoda
OL,15,FKaroq and a grey Hyundai i30 between
OL,16,Fthe Newbridge and Gogar roundabouts at
OL,17,Faround 09:25 on Tuesday.
OL,19,FEmergency services attended, however,
OL,20,Fthe 58-year-old driver of the Hyundai
OL,21,Fi30 was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
